/**
 * features/rag/types/documents.ts
 *
 * Wire shapes for the unified document API at /api/document/*.
 *
 * DERIVED from the generated OpenAPI contract
 * (`types/python-generated/api-types.ts`, regenerated by `pnpm sync-types`) —
 * never hand-mirrored. When the Pydantic models in
 * `aidream/api/routers/document.py` change, regenerating the contract makes
 * every drifted consumer a compile error instead of a silent runtime drift
 * (this file previously hand-mirrored these shapes and had already diverged:
 * missing `section_subtype`, invented required-ness on contract-optional
 * fields — see FOUND_DEFECTS.md D44).
 *
 * Backed by:
 *   - docproc.processed_documents      (Phase 4A)
 *   - docproc.processed_document_pages (Phase 4A)
 *   - rag.kg_chunks (with FK to processed_documents) (Phase 4A/4B)
 */

